							"settings": {
								"html": "<p class=\"bt-landing-verify\"><strong>REQUIRES BUSINESS VERIFICATION</strong> — this page makes no claim about curriculum accreditation, insurance cover, safeguarding certification, free teacher places, staff-to-student ratios, risk assessment documentation or fixed group pricing. Do not add any of these without written verification — the legacy page carried several. Confirm what Brother Tours actually provides on safety, insurance and safeguarding, and state only that.</p>"
