										"tab_title": "What group sizes do you work with?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Tell us your group size and staffing and we will confirm what we can support for your dates.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "c6f61e5",
										"tab_title": "How far ahead should we plan?",
										"tab_content": "<p>As early as possible. Institutional approvals and site arrangements both take time, and the best field sites are limited.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "2116609",
										"tab_title": "Can the programme match our syllabus?",
										"tab_content": "<p>That is how it is built. Send the learning objectives first and the itinerary is designed to them.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "46b9afc",
										"tab_title": "Who is with the group on the ground?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Licensed Lao guides and a Brother Tours coordinator, alongside your own faculty. Specific arrangements are agreed with your institution in advance.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "1636b1b",
										"tab_title": "How is it priced?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Per programme, confirmed on request once group size, dates and content are settled.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "c4ba64b",
										"tab_title": "Do you arrange service-learning components?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Where a community genuinely wants one and it can be done well. We would rather decline than arrange something performative.</p>"
